/P 116 0 R
/E (Wildlife Awareness: The area is home to diverse wildlife. Be cautious of animals when driving, especially around dawn or dusk when many animals are most active.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Pack Essentials: Given the remote nature of Big Bend, make sure to pack essentials like snacks, first-aid kit, and any medicines you might need. While we provide a comfortable stay, it's always good to be prepared.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Night Driving: If you're unfamiliar with the area, try to avoid driving at night. Road signs can be sparse, and with minimal light pollution, it can get exceptionally dark, making navigation tricky.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
