241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (Power: While being in such an unspoiled, remote area has its advantages, the power grid can be less consistent. A downed power pole many miles up the road can send the whole county into darkness. Our power company monitors outages remotely and usually has things up and running in a few hours. If you are experiencing an isolated issue, please let us know immediately. If the entire property is out of power and you need cell service, head back down the road to Hwy 170 where you will have cell reception.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (WIFI: Wi-Fi is available on-site to help you stay connected through calls, texts, and messaging. Signal strength and speeds vary, and you may need to step outside your accommodation for a better connection. This enables us to relay important on-site updates to you, especially given that cell service can be quite inconsistent in this region.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (Bugs and Wildlife: Your comfort is our priority, and so we actively manage bugs with regular treatments by our staff and monthly professional services. Yet, our closeness to the wild might occasionally bring uninvited little guests. Should you encounter any issues, please inform us immediately so we can swiftly address it.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
