247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 119 0 R
/T (Temperature Control: Welcome to the desert, where temperatures can be a wild ride! Your room \(with the exception of Casa Grande\) is equipped with a remote-controlled mini-split AC, which not only cools during summer days but also heats during the chilly winter months. During the intense heat of summer, it's natural for the domes to feel warm, but rest assured, once the sun sets, these powerful units will quickly cool your space. On the flip side, they'll keep you toasty warm during cooler months. Please let us know if you have any questions or need assistance with the AC settings.)
/E (Temperature Control: Welcome to the desert, where temperatures can be a wild ride! Your room \(with the exception of Casa Grande\) is equipped with a remote-controlled mini-split AC, which not only cools during summer days but also heats during the chilly winter months. During the intense heat of summer, it's natural for the domes to feel warm, but rest assured, once the sun sets, these powerful units will quickly cool your space. On the flip side, they'll keep you toasty warm during cooler months. Please let us know if you have any questions or need assistance with the AC settings.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 119 0 R
/T (Food & Cooking: We believe that food tastes better when cooked under the vast open skies! If your accommodation doesn't come with its own grill, experience authentic outdoor cooking at our propane kitchens located in sections 2 and 3. Just be sure to pack your favorite grill items and utensils. And if the propane runs low, give us a quick text, and we will replace it. You are also welcome to cook over your accommodations fire pit.  )
/E (Food & Cooking: We believe that food tastes better when cooked under the vast open skies! If your accommodation doesn't come with its own grill, experience authentic outdoor cooking at our propane kitchens located in sections 2 and 3. Just be sure to pack your favorite grill items and utensils. And if the propane runs low, give us a quick text, and we will replace it. You are also welcome to cook over your accommodations fire pit.  )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
