434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (All kinds of planes fly into Lajitas. Anyone can fly their own plane into the Lajitas airport with 24 hour notice to the airport FBO. \(Pilots will know how to get in contact\). JSX is a company that offers charters from Houston Hobby, Austin, and Dallas. They run seasonally.)
