436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (This is the middle of the Chihuahuan Desert which means you might experience power outages \(this includes WiFi\) along with everyone else in the area. Although inconvenient, they typically do not last for more than a few hours.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (We have tried to disturb the natural landscape as little as possible. Most of our accommodations have parking next to the unit. However, the natural landscape required a few units to be built with walks of 20 yards or more and some inclines. This may include the use of stairs to reach your accommodations, the bathhouses in the Valley, or parked vehicles. If you have mobility issues, please contact us so that we may suit your needs.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [10]
>>
