/Title (Today, the area serves primarily as a tourist destination, especially for visitors to the nearby Big Bend National Park. It offers a range of outdoor activities like rafting, canoeing, mountain biking, camping, hiking, and motorcycling. The region is also famous for its annual chili cookoffs, attracting thousands of enthusiasts each November. The Terlingua Cemetery, with graves dating back to the mining era, is another point of interest, particularly during the Dia de los Muertos celebrations. Additionally, Terlingua has featured in movies and TV shows, adding to its cultural allure)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1554 0 R
>>
