1602 0 obj
<<
/Title (Temperature Control: Welcome to the desert, where temperatures can be a wild ride! Your room \(with the exception of Casa Grande\) is equipped with a remote-controlled mini-split AC, which not only cools during summer days but also heats during the chilly winter months. During the intense heat of summer, it's natural for the domes to feel warm, but rest assured, once the sun sets, these powerful units will quickly cool your space. On the flip side, they'll keep you toasty warm during cooler months. Please let us know if you have any questions or need assistance with the AC settings.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1601 0 R
/Next 1595 0 R
>>
endobj
1603 0 obj
<<
/Title (The old mines, caves, and cliff edges are known for their unpredictable nature. Tread with caution. Kindly familiarize yourself with our liability waiver - we are not responsible for any injuries, death, vehicle troubles, or lost/stolen items while on our property. Our priority is your safety and enjoyment, but we aren't equipped for rescue or recovery missions. The nearest major hospital is a good 4-hour drive away.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1591 0 R
/Prev 1596 0 R
/Next 1604 0 R
>>
endobj
